          "at": "2026-11-15T21:19:49.148Z",
          "html": "<p>Agreed:  <code>epic</code> keeps running main's code everywhere, so one broken worktree can't break the page tooling for every session.</p><p>I300 is closed as decided, with nothing changed.  A worktree that changes the epic tool tries its own copy with <code>./epic/bin/epic</code>.</p>"
